  "question": "\"A black metal mining company owns multiple mines, each with various mineral resources. Mineral resources have Attributes such as resource ID, name, reserves, discovery date, and the mine where it was first discovered. Mines have Attributes such as mine ID, name, location, and person in charge. Each extraction of mineral resources must record data including extraction date, extraction volume, and extraction cost. The information system must be capable of statistical analysis of the extraction of mineral resources.\"",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0486\n\nCREATE TABLE `mine` (\n  `mine_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `mine_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `location` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `person_in_charge` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`mine_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `mineral_resource` (\n  `resource_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `resource_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `reserves` decimal(15,2) NOT NULL,\n  `discovery_date` date NOT NULL,\n  `mine_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`resource_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `mineral_resource_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`mine_id`) REFERENCES `mine` (`mine_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `extraction_record` (\n  `extraction_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `resource_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `mine_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `extraction_date` date NOT NULL,\n  `extraction_volume` decimal(15,2) NOT NULL,\n  `extraction_cost` decimal(15,2) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`extraction_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `extraction_record_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`resource_id`) REFERENCES `mineral_resource` (`resource_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `extraction_record_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`mine_id`) REFERENCES `mine` (`mine_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
